\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Matched-condition endpoint comparisons. (a) Development observations at 6,000 updates. (b) Retained final observations at 24,000 updates. Each dot is a recorded seed; no missing cell is plotted at zero. The panels use different seeds and disjoint input pools, so their contrast is not a duration-only intervention. At width 128, norm matching duplicates the studied scientific trajectory; horizontally separated symbols do not denote independent evidence.}}{5}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:endpoint}{{2}{5}{Matched-condition endpoint comparisons. (a) Development observations at 6,000 updates. (b) Retained final observations at 24,000 updates. Each dot is a recorded seed; no missing cell is plotted at zero. The panels use different seeds and disjoint input pools, so their contrast is not a duration-only intervention. At width 128, norm matching duplicates the studied scientific trajectory; horizontally separated symbols do not denote independent evidence}{figure.caption.7}{}}
